{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:5d271a2ef73d902c","name":"Hidden Cargo Hold","source":{"id":"source:reference-5d271a2ef73d902c","title":"Hidden Cargo Hold","revision":19680,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:24:36Z","sha256":"62be798a748842bc306b5f24aec50e584082c71338177b44e3e82c7f49a4f94f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19680","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Hidden%20Cargo%20Hold&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-5d271a2ef73d902c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}," "]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["HIDDEN CARGO HOLD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["EP\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["AVAILABILITY\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COST\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["25% of Cargo\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2,000 (Base)\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["50% of Cargo\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5,000 (Base)\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["75% of Cargo\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["4\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10,000 (Base)\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["A Hidden Cargo Hold is a large cargo area that is not on a ship's normal schematics, and that requires access through a false wall or hidden hatch. It is similar to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Smuggler's Compartments"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Smuggler%27s_Compartments","referenceId":"reference:6224a00fc8bd0549"},", with two important differences. First, up to half a Starships' Cargo Capacity can be converted to Hidden Cargo Holds. Second, a cursory investigation of a ship reveals that a section of the ship can't be reached (requiring a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check during a routine inspection lasting 1 minute x Starship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Modifier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Modifier"},"). However, it requires a closer inspection to find the access to the Hidden Cargo Holds (requiring a DC 25 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check during a detailed inspection lasting 1 hour x Starship's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Modifier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Modifier"},"). This makes such holds useful for smugglers who can bribe their way past formal inspections, depending only on their concealment to keep their goods hidden from casual eyes.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["It is also possible for a Hidden Cargo Hold to be concealed as another part of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"},", such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Systems"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sublight Drives"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sublight_Drives"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reinforced Bulkheads"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reinforced_Bulkheads","referenceId":"reference:2a08010bca2e64b5"},". This is only slightly more effective, requiring a DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check during a routine inspection to realize not all is as it seems, and requires an additional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Emplacement Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emplacement_Point"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
